{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.AlphaKCategoricalClosure","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.AlphaKCategoricalClosure","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.QPlancherel"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.cal3_direction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.cal3_direction","kind":"theorem","line":84,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L84-L84","doc":"**Sub-claim 3 (CAL-3 direction)**: the framework-derived $E_0$\nagrees with the CODATA-calibrated value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.selection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.selection","kind":"theorem","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L81-L81","doc":"**Sub-claim 2 (selection)**: the Frobenius pairing fixes the\ngeometric family $\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{geom}}(x) = 1/(1-x)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.existence","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.existence","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L78-L78","doc":"**Sub-claim 1 (existence)**: the categorical $\\alpha_k$ family\nadmits the closed-form resummation $\\mathcal{F}(\\hbar_q^2)$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.E0_codata","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.E0_codata","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L75-L75","doc":"CODATA-calibrated $E_0^{(\\mathrm{cal})}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.E0_framework","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.E0_framework","kind":"def","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L73-L73","doc":"Framework-derived $E_0$ from the selected closure. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.hbarQSq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.hbarQSq","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L71-L71","doc":"The substrate quantity $\\hbar_q^2$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.Fgeom","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.Fgeom","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L69-L69","doc":"The geometric closed-form candidate $\\mathcal{F}_{\\mathrm{geom}}$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.resummation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.resummation","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L67-L67","doc":"The categorical resummation value $\\sum_k \\alpha_k (\\hbar_q^2)^k$. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure.mk","kind":"ctor","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L64-L64","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AlphaKCategoricalClosure","kind":"class","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L52-L84","doc":"**Categorical-closure conjecture** for the stratum prefactors\n$\\alpha_k$ in the unified mass formula.\n\nThe three fields encode the three sub-claims of\n`conj:alpha-k-categorical-closure`:\n  1. **existence** of a closed form $\\mathcal{F}(\\hbar_q^2)$ for the\n     resummation $\\sum_k \\alpha_k (\\hbar_q^2)^k$;\n  2. **selection** of the geometric family $\\mathcal{F}(x)=1/(1-x)$\n     (over the symmetric $\\mathrm{Li}_2^q$ family) by the Frobenius\n     pairing;\n  3. **CAL-3 direction**: the framework-derived $E_0$ agrees with the\n     CODATA-calibrated value (rather than overshooting). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:alpha-k-categorical-closure","label":"conj:alpha-k-categorical-closure","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.alphaKStratumWeight_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.alphaKStratumWeight_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L45-L50","doc":"The stratum Wedderburn weights are non-negative — a **proved**\n(sorry-free) consequence of $q$-Plancherel positivity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.alphaKStratumWeight","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.alphaKStratumWeight","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/alpha-k-categorical-closure.lean#L38-L43","doc":"The **Wedderburn weight** $W_\\lambda = d_q(\\lambda)^2 / Z_q(k)$ that\nthe Markov pairing assigns to the stratum prefactors $\\alpha_k$,\nrealised as the canonical $q$-Plancherel measure. ","signatureChunk":0}]}